- Keep provider classes focused on a single domain or feature
- Separate state and logic with clear responsibilities
- Implement proper error handling and loading states
- Use ChangeNotifier for simple state
- Notify listeners only when state actually changes
- Dispose of resources properly in dispose() methods
- Organize providers logically by feature
- Use provider hierarchies appropriately
- Avoid unnecessary dependencies between providers
- Consider performance implications of notifyListeners()
- Document state transitions and side effects
